01:27:18.404 --> 01:27:21.742
Laying down here.

01:27:22.903 --> 01:27:23.944
You really are the worst.

01:27:25.586 --> 01:27:26.468
Goodbye.

01:27:26.492 --> 01:27:27.492
This is it, really.

01:27:27.713 --> 01:27:28.713
Come back.

01:27:28.814 --> 01:27:29.971
I don't even have a noise.

01:27:30.256 --> 01:27:31.392
Bill and I came back.

01:27:31.472 --> 01:27:32.533
See you soon.

01:27:45.375 --> 01:27:46.375
Hey!

01:27:47.206 --> 01:27:48.606
You sure you want to go back Henry?

01:27:49.817 --> 01:27:50.817
It won't feel like this.

01:27:52.178 --> 01:27:57.241
There you got constraints,
judgements, obstacles.

01:27:57.761 --> 01:27:58.761
Yeah, I know.

01:27:59.291 --> 01:28:00.811
But I'm going to go make stuff anyway.

01:28:04.064 --> 01:28:05.064
I like that.

01:28:06.945 --> 01:28:07.945
You're a brave kid.

01:28:09.206 --> 01:28:11.907
Steve, you still cool with this?

01:28:17.001 --> 01:28:20.849
And if we... Yeah.

01:28:21.084 --> 01:28:22.390
Of course, I still love you.

01:28:23.026 --> 01:28:24.652
That's why I think this is a good idea.

01:28:25.788 --> 01:28:27.014
You changed my life.

01:28:29.375 --> 01:28:31.015
It's time for you to go change hers, too.

01:28:31.518 --> 01:28:32.518
Earth?

01:28:32.729 --> 01:28:34.020
Go now.

01:28:34.680 --> 01:28:35.680
Dennis.

01:28:36.267 --> 01:28:38.403
Change Dawn's life.

01:28:38.764 --> 01:28:39.764
Dennis.

01:28:40.140 --> 01:28:41.886
Go on a journey.

01:28:42.997 --> 01:28:44.568
And think of me.

01:28:45.889 --> 01:28:46.889
Dennis.

01:28:56.845 --> 01:29:03.445
If I would've known you could sing like
that, it would help me get past your smell.

01:29:03.525 --> 01:29:04.525
Garrett?

01:29:18.101 --> 01:29:19.827
You are a truly bodacious warrior.

01:29:21.118 --> 01:29:22.169
And a really good friend.

01:29:23.595 --> 01:29:24.950
I wish you'd come home with us.

01:29:27.052 --> 01:29:28.052
Thanks, cool.

01:29:28.293 --> 01:29:30.454
But I don't have any friends.

01:29:31.049 --> 01:29:32.049
My age.

01:29:38.214 --> 01:29:39.760
You can make a great team.

01:29:42.391 --> 01:29:43.562
But I'll come to you.

01:29:45.142 --> 01:29:46.182
It needs to be my brother.

01:29:47.465 --> 01:29:48.465
No, it doesn't.

01:29:49.450 --> 01:29:50.450
Don't look at her.

01:29:50.871 --> 01:29:51.662
It does.

01:29:51.686 --> 01:29:52.812
No, it does not.

01:29:53.892 --> 01:29:54.892
That does.

01:29:57.739 --> 01:29:58.739
Love you guys!

01:29:59.925 --> 01:30:01.565
Are you sure you don't want to come back?

01:30:01.871 --> 01:30:03.037
Yeah, I'm staying here.

01:30:03.077 --> 01:30:04.878
I got a bunch more stuff I want to build.

01:30:06.719 --> 01:30:08.959
Why don't you bring some of
that magic to the real world?

01:30:30.555 --> 01:30:31.561
Screw it.

01:30:31.566 --> 01:30:32.566
I'm coming with.

01:30:35.703 --> 01:30:39.386
Turns out the overworld taught us
you can create the life you dream of.

01:30:40.867 --> 01:30:46.050
Even in the real world, Garrett's
store became the hottest place in town.

01:30:46.150 --> 01:30:49.092
And the best part is new
friends were never far.

01:30:50.673 --> 01:30:55.709
So with Henry and Natalie's help, we created
the hit game, Block City Battle Buddies.

01:30:57.432 --> 01:31:00.494
All that time in the
overworld of everyone's game.

01:31:02.315 --> 01:31:05.297
In every Friday, I would let it rip.

01:31:05.597 --> 01:31:10.520
Yeah!

01:31:10.660 --> 01:31:13.702
I used to wake up and
play back in my childhood.

01:31:13.802 --> 01:31:17.944
They used to know that such a dirty shame.

01:31:18.004 --> 01:31:21.866
They got my baby a chance
to let my imagination dance.

01:31:21.946 --> 01:31:24.448
Hell, I came up with a different game.

01:31:34.897 --> 01:31:40.922
Never have a lookin'
back cause I'll feel like this!

01:31:42.503 --> 01:31:45.085
John finally got to
ditch a real estate job.

01:31:46.086 --> 01:31:48.388
She and Dennis brought
the party wherever they went.

01:31:49.869 --> 01:31:53.191
Natalie decided to share her
new skill set with the real world.

01:31:53.912 --> 01:31:59.356
Survival mode, self-defense!

01:32:00.182 --> 01:32:02.559
The streets are truckless
and never been safer.

01:32:03.059 --> 01:32:04.059
You got them Natalie!

01:32:05.627 --> 01:32:09.270
And Henry, he finally
got that jet back to work.

01:32:34.059 --> 01:32:37.953
The rest don't know
the dry eye I feel the

01:32:37.977 --> 01:32:42.071
hurtful With the power
of the world of sight

01:33:04.193 --> 01:33:05.794
I know how much you look bred.

01:33:07.945 --> 01:33:09.836
Marlene, your ex-husband's here.

01:33:10.096 --> 01:33:11.216
He said it was an emergency.

01:33:11.312 --> 01:33:14.819
Well, you tell him I've
got nothing to say to him.

01:33:15.359 --> 01:33:16.760
You got to be kidding me, Marlene.

01:33:17.125 --> 01:33:18.125
This is the guy.

01:33:18.621 --> 01:33:19.741
Too late, Clemente.

01:33:20.336 --> 01:33:21.542
You had your chance.

01:33:21.782 --> 01:33:23.083
She's right, Clemente.

01:33:23.513 --> 01:33:24.544
You totally blew it.

01:33:25.124 --> 01:33:28.606
And now I read the rewards of your mistake.

01:33:31.416 --> 01:33:35.447
You see, when Marlene's Jeep Grand
Cherokee ran me over, I was struck by

01:33:35.471 --> 01:33:39.403
a love so powerful it transcended
the barriers of conventional speech.

01:33:40.031 --> 01:33:46.435
Now I speak human and she speaks villager.

01:33:51.417 --> 01:33:57.020
Marlene ever since we met last night,
I wanted to say, would you marry me?

01:33:57.040 --> 01:33:58.040
Yes!

01:33:59.493 --> 01:34:00.493
Yes!

01:34:00.576 --> 01:34:01.667
A thousand times!

01:34:01.728 --> 01:34:02.728
Yes!
